clark: I have a missed called. It's from my neighbour Evelyn
clark: She left me a voice message
evelyn: Good evening, Clark. I haven't seen in a while. I hope you and Claire doing great
evelyn: Listen, this is hard to tell and I don't even know to to do it.
evelyn: Leon was wandering around my house this morning.
evelyn: He saw a ball on the other side of the road.
evelyn: He ran towards it without thinking it twice.
evelyn: A truck that was going by didn't see him and...
evelyn: I'm so sorry, Clark.
evelyn: I know you were so bonded together and Claire loved him so much.
evelyn: I buried the corpse myself in the backyard of my house.
evelyn: He has some flowers.
evelyn: If you ever need a hug or someone to talk to, here I am for you and Claire.
evelyn: At least Claire is with you.
evelyn: I really like this girl for you. I hope you get engaged one day
clark: Yeah, keep dreaming.
evelyn: Again, I'm so sorry for you loss. Best wishes.
